# Project Constraints & Rules

- Stack: Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, SQLite, Prisma ORM.
- Philosophy: Lean, simple, lightweight. Avoid unnecessary third-party packages.
- Security: All API routes must validate input types strictly (using Zod) and check rate limits.
- Database: SQLite file-based database stored locally.
- Target Environment: Self-hosted Node.js server behind Apache reverse proxy.